IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `jtca-corporation`

-- Jurong Town Corporation Act 1968, ss 5, 8, 9, 12, 13, 24, 27, 33, 35, 35A, 35C, 35D, 57, 59-62, 67 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_jurong-town-corporation-act-1968.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

